 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<p>If you can find buchimgaru (Korean pancake mix), use <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"130\" data-s=\"0\">130 g</span> of it instead of the flour, starch and salt, with the same water.</p>",
   "title_html": "Korean pancake mix"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>A steel pan releases the pancake once a crust forms.</li><li>Preheat it well, use the full amount of oil and don't try to move the pancake in the first 2 minutes.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Stopping it sticking"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Kimchi pancake: replace the seafood with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"150\" data-s=\"0\">150 g</span> chopped kimchi plus <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 tbsp</span> of its juice in the batter.</li><li>Vegetable: courgette and onion in thin strips.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Other fillings"
  }
 ],
