 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the spring onions to the width of your pan, about <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"20\" data-s=\"0\">20 cm</span></b>. Split the thick white ends lengthwise so they cook as fast as the greens.</li><li>Cut the shrimp in half and the squid into thin rings. Pat everything dry. Slice the chilli thinly, if using. Mix the dipping sauce.</li></ul>",
