   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Whisk the flour, starch and salt with the <b>ice-cold water</b> until just smooth; a few lumps are fine. It should be thin, like single cream. Cold batter and little mixing keep the pancake crisp.</li><li>Beat the egg separately in a cup; it goes on top later.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Mix a cold, thin batter",
