   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~3 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~3 min</span>",
   "title": "Mix a cold, thin batter",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"100\">100 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Plain flour"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"30\">30 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Potato starch or cornflour"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Salt"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"160\">160 ml</span>",
     "name_html": "Ice-cold water"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-n=\"1\">1</span>",
     "name_html": "Egg"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the steel pan on <b>medium-high</b> for 2 minutes, then add <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">3 tbsp</span> oil</b> and swirl. Lay half the spring onions side by side across the pan.</li><li>Scatter half the seafood and chilli over them. Spoon half the batter evenly over everything, just enough to fill the gaps and bind it; you should still see the onions. Drizzle half the beaten egg over the top.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
