    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Fry for <b>3–4 minutes</b>, pressing gently with the spatula, until the underside is golden and the edges are crisp. Shake the pan: it should slide freely.</li><li>To flip, slide the pancake onto a large plate, put the pan upside down over it and turn both over together. Add <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> oil</b> around the edge and fry for <b>3 minutes</b>, pressing down. Turn once more for 30 seconds to re-crisp the first side.</li><li>Make the second pancake the same way.</li></ul>",
